// The status line under the composer (hn.ChatPane's foot.status): its words, and den's model and effort picker in it
// (hn.ChatPick, src/app/chat/pick.rs): each word its own control chat_pick_h tall, chat_pick_gap apart, the chevron
// chat_pick_chevron across; the context meter after them (hn.ChatContext) a ring chat_ring across, its stroke
// chat_ring_stroke, chat_context_gap from its percentage. The model's name leads with its maker's mark (Claude's,
// OpenAI's, Cursor's) chat_pick_mark across, chat_pick_mark_gap before the name. The picker's menu is a ui.Menu (the
// menu_* tokens). The agent's state at its end is an icon (scene/widgets/chat_status.flecs) chat_status_icon across. The
// foot keeps tight: the input and the status line chat_foot_gap apart, chat_foot_pad_b under it, the status line's parts
// chat_status_gap apart.
